# CODEOWNERS — branch-protection enforced reviewers for the security
# perimeter of the bifurcated CI/CD pipeline.
#
# Required by GitHub branch protection: PRs touching any of these paths must
# be approved by at least one member of the listed team. The workflow itself
# cannot approve its own PRs.

# Both pipeline workflows + any other workflow added later
.github/workflows/        @qa-platform-team

# Security primitives — secret guard, sanitizers, XSD validator
ci/security/              @security-team

# Anything the QA agent reads as configuration / instructions
.claude/                  @qa-platform-team
AGENTS.md                 @qa-platform-team
